{"abstract":[{"text":"Controls how strictly a test store checks pending events when observation","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"finishes.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/innoroutertesting\/testexhaustivity"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/InnoSquadCorp\/InnoRouter\/blob\/5.0.0\/Sources\/InnoRouterTesting\/TestExhaustivity.swift#L25","fileName":"TestExhaustivity.swift"},"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TestExhaustivity","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"TestExhaustivity","modules":[{"name":"InnoRouterTesting"}],"roleHeading":"Enumeration","externalID":"s:17InnoRouterTesting16TestExhaustivityO","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"TestExhaustivity","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"enum"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.spatial\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.spatial\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/TestExhaustivity","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TestExhaustivity","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"InnoRouter’s test stores follow TCA’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TestStore"},{"type":"text","text":" exhaustivity model:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"events collected from the underlying authority’s unified "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onEvent"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"callback accumulate in an internal queue. Each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"receive(...)"},{"type":"text","text":" call dequeues the next event and asserts a predicate. In"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".strict"},{"type":"text","text":" mode, the store reports events left pending at "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"finish()"},{"type":"text","text":" or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deallocation."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"assertNoPendingEvents()"},{"type":"text","text":" is a non-terminal checkpoint: it reports and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"consumes the current pending snapshot, then continues observing. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"finish()"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"closes the queue, consumes its final snapshot, and reports the first event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"emitted after that boundary in both exhaustivity modes."}]},{"style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift Testing currently attributes issues recorded inside an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"isolated "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"deinit"},{"type":"text","text":" to an "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"unknown test"}]},{"type":"text","text":" rather than to the test that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"owned the store, which makes a deinit-time leftover-event failure"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"hard to locate. Until that is resolved upstream, await all work and end"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each test with an explicit "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"finish()"},{"type":"text","text":". It runs the strict check with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"caller’s source location and disarms the deinit-time fallback."}]}],"name":"Note","type":"aside"}]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.spatial\/SQ","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.spatial\/SH","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.spatial\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.spatial\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.spatial\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/TestExhaustivity\/off","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.spatial\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/TestExhaustivity\/strict"],"title":"Enumeration Cases","generated":true,"anchor":"Enumeration-Cases"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.spatial\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/TestExhaustivity\/Equatable-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.spatial/documentation/InnoRouterTesting/TestExhaustivity":{"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.spatial\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/TestExhaustivity","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"TestExhaustivity"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"TestExhaustivity","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Controls how strictly a test store checks pending events when observation"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"finishes."}],"url":"\/documentation\/innoroutertesting\/testexhaustivity","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"TestExhaustivity"}]},"doc://com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.spatial/SQ":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.spatial\/SQ","type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Equatable"},"doc://com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.spatial/documentation/InnoRouterTesting/TestExhaustivity/strict":{"abstract":[{"text":"Every observed event must be drained through ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"receive(...)"},{"text":" before","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"finish()"},{"text":" or deallocation. Pending events fail the test. This is the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"default and matches TCA’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"exhaustive"},{"text":" semantics.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.spatial\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/TestExhaustivity\/strict","kind":"symbol","title":"TestExhaustivity.strict","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"strict"}],"url":"\/documentation\/innoroutertesting\/testexhaustivity\/strict"},"doc://com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.spatial/s8SendableP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.spatial\/s8SendableP","type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Sendable"},"doc://com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.spatial/documentation/InnoRouterTesting/TestExhaustivity/off":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The test store still delivers events through "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"receive(...)"},{"type":"text","text":", but pending"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"events at "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"finish()"},{"type":"text","text":" or deallocation are silently discarded. Explicit"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"assertions and events emitted after "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"finish()"},{"type":"text","text":" still report issues."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Useful for incremental migrations of large legacy suites."}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.spatial\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/TestExhaustivity\/off","kind":"symbol","title":"TestExhaustivity.off","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"off","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/innoroutertesting\/testexhaustivity\/off"},"doc://com.innosquad.innorouter.